---

<ApplicationLayout
  title="Alfa Laval WHPX 510 Self-Cleaning Waste Oil Centrifuge | Dolphin Centrifuge"
  heroTitle="Alfa Laval WHPX 510 Self-Cleaning Waste Oil Centrifuge"
  description="Alfa Laval WHPX 510 self-cleaning disc centrifuge. Diesel application capacity: 10,700 L/h (47.11 US GPM) at 13 cSt and 40 C. 10 HP, 5,180 RPM."
  category="products"
  categoryLabel="Products"
  heroImage="/images/alfa-laval-whpx-510-centrifuge/whpx-510-hero-2000x600.webp"
  heroImageAlt="Dolphin DMPX-042 self-cleaning disc stack centrifuge system built around the Alfa Laval WHPX 510 bowl"
  canonicalUrl="https://dolphincentrifuge.com/alfa-laval-whpx-510-centrifuge/"
