  <h2 id="mopx-310">Also Available: MOPX 310 Total-Discharge</h2>

  <div class="not-prose mb-6">
    <div>
      <p class="text-text-light mb-4">
        The Alfa Laval MOPX 310 is a self-cleaning disc-stack centrifuge in the same size class, designed for three-phase separation of <a href="/pyrolysis-oil-centrifuge/" class="text-navy font-semibold hover:text-gold transition-colors">industrial oil</a>, <a href="/lube-oil-centrifuge/" class="text-navy font-semibold hover:text-gold transition-colors">lube oil</a>, <a href="/wvo-centrifuge-separator/" class="text-navy font-semibold hover:text-gold transition-colors">WVO</a>, <a href="/black-diesel-centrifuge/" class="text-navy font-semibold hover:text-gold transition-colors">black diesel</a>, and other mineral oils. With a 10 HP motor at 5,180 RPM, it processes 25 GPM of <a href="/disc-stack-centrifuge-remove-metals-ash-used-oil/" class="text-navy font-semibold hover:text-gold transition-colors">used oil</a> at 180&deg;F.
      </p>
